## 📌 Project Description
This Python project predicts **blood sugar status** (`Normal`, `Pre-Diabetes`, `Diabetes`) using **FBS, RBS, HbA1c**, and calculates a **risk factor score** based on **Age, BMI, Blood Pressure, Exercise, Family History, and Smoking**.  

Key features:
- Batch processing of patient data via **CSV files**  
- Generates **QR codes** for WhatsApp or other actions  
- User-friendly **Gradio web interface** for non-programmers  
- Ideal for **healthcare practitioners, students, and Python beginners**  

---

## 🛠 Tools & Libraries Used
- Python 3.x  
- [Pandas](https://pandas.pydata.org/) – data processing  
- [Gradio](https://gradio.app/) – interactive web interface  
- [qrcode](https://pypi.org/project/qrcode/) – QR code generation  
- Base64 & BytesIO – image encoding  

